# Settings for the paid runs. Nothing else reads them: the suite, the
# mutation checks and every offline script run without a key.
#
# Keys are read ONLY from the file ENV_FILE names, never from the ambient
# environment, so a stray exported key cannot bill the wrong account. Keep
# that file outside every repository (e.g. ~/.secrets/ai.env, chmod 600):
#     ENV_FILE=~/.secrets/ai.env python scripts/real_run.py --probe
# If you copy this template to .env inside the repository instead, point
# ENV_FILE at it; .env is ignored by git. Never commit it.

# In the file ENV_FILE names, required only for the matching provider:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Optional, in the environment: a directory holding the DejaVu .ttf files,
# searched before the system font directories.
# VEI_FONT_DIR=/usr/share/fonts/truetype/dejavu
